WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:08.746
It was the last day of cooking class, and Izzie felt nervous.

2
00:00:08.747 --> 00:00:13.988
Guests were coming for a special meal after class.

3
00:00:13.989 --> 00:00:17.724
She wanted to make Chef proud of them.

4
00:00:17.725 --> 00:00:21.919
"Remember, Chef, don't help us!" Izzie said.

5
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:25.493
"We picked the appetizer recipe ourselves.

6
00:00:25.494 --> 00:00:28.991
We can make it ourselves too!"

7
00:00:28.992 --> 00:00:31.745
Chef leaned against the counter.

8
00:00:31.746 --> 00:00:35.801
"I won't do a thing. I promise."

9
00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:38.469
"Good," Bobby said.

10
00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:44.216
"Let's get started on the party pinwheels," Nina said.

11
00:00:44.217 --> 00:00:47.466
"The cream cheese is soft!"

12
00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:50.858
Izzie put the cream cheese into a bowl.

13
00:00:50.859 --> 00:00:54.354
Jason added chopped green onions.

14
00:00:54.355 --> 00:00:58.106
Bobby stirred the ingredients together.

15
00:00:58.107 --> 00:01:02.949
They each spread a tortilla with a thin layer of cream cheese.

16
00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:07.352
"Be sure to spread it to the edges," Jason said.

17
00:01:07.353 --> 00:01:11.000
Next they chose fillings.

18
00:01:11.001 --> 00:01:16.846
Izzie covered her tortilla with chopped tomato, bell pepper, and cucumber.

19
00:01:16.847 --> 00:01:19.258
Bobby chose ham and cheese.

20
00:01:19.259 --> 00:01:23.649
"My pinwheels will be delicious!"

21
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:27.379
Jason sprinkled diced red onion on his tortilla.

22
00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:31.308
He added chicken and avocado.

23
00:01:31.309 --> 00:01:37.330
Nina put sliced mushroom, tomato, and mozzarella cheese on her tortilla.

24
00:01:37.331 --> 00:01:41.559
"Chef will like mine best," Izzie thought.

25
00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:46.256
"I used only vegetables from his garden."

26
00:01:46.257 --> 00:01:50.130
The kids rolled their tortillas up to form tubes.

27
00:01:50.131 --> 00:01:53.741
They wrapped them in plastic wrap.

28
00:01:53.742 --> 00:01:56.182
"Now we have to chill them.

29
00:01:56.183 --> 00:02:00.029
Then they'll be easy to slice," Izzie said.

30
00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:06.214
"They have to look like pinwheels!"

31
00:02:06.215 --> 00:02:09.746
They put their rolls in the refrigerator.

32
00:02:09.747 --> 00:02:13.623
Izzie looked at Chef, who was quietly reading recipes.

33
00:02:13.624 --> 00:02:15.503
"Good job, Chef."

34
00:02:15.504 --> 00:02:20.637
He gave her a thumbs-up. "You too."

35
00:02:20.638 --> 00:02:23.626
The kids set out everything they had prepared.

36
00:02:23.627 --> 00:02:27.631
They had worked hard during the last two classes.

37
00:02:27.632 --> 00:02:31.634
There were salmon cakes, cheesy spinach balls, and bread.

38
00:02:31.635 --> 00:02:35.430
For dessert, they made peach cookies.

39
00:02:35.431 --> 00:02:41.669
Izzie sighed. "The table looks perfect!"

40
00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:47.581
"Let's finish our pinwheels," Nina said.

41
00:02:47.582 --> 00:02:51.917
They took the tortilla rolls from the refrigerator and unwrapped them.

42
00:02:51.918 --> 00:02:56.194
They each sliced their tortilla to create pinwheels.

43
00:02:56.195 --> 00:02:59.502
"They look awesome!"

44
00:02:59.503 --> 00:03:03.741
Izzie placed them on two trays.

45
00:03:03.742 --> 00:03:07.465
Just then Cinnamon burst into the room.

46
00:03:07.466 --> 00:03:11.305
The dog jumped up, putting her paws on the table.

47
00:03:11.306 --> 00:03:14.525
A tray of pinwheels crashed to the floor!

48
00:03:14.526 --> 00:03:19.839
Cinnamon gobbled up several pinwheels before Bobby led her away.

49
00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:24.900
Nina sighed. "At least one tray is left."

50
00:03:24.901 --> 00:03:28.122
"What a disaster."

51
00:03:28.123 --> 00:03:32.374
Izzie looked down, waiting for Chef to snap at them.

52
00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:37.943
"I'll help you clean up," he said calmly. "If I'm allowed."

53
00:03:37.944 --> 00:03:44.034
"You must be glad this is our last class," Izzie mumbled.

54
00:03:44.035 --> 00:03:47.418
"What?" Chef shook his head.

55
00:03:47.419 --> 00:03:49.669
"I'm so proud of you!

56
00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:55.440
You've learned so much—including that cooking sometimes involves mistakes.

57
00:03:55.441 --> 00:03:59.257
But there's always a solution."

58
00:03:59.258 --> 00:04:04.099
Izzie smiled. "I'll remember that!"

59
00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:07.176
Soon everything was ready.

60
00:04:07.177 --> 00:04:10.564
The first guest arrived.

61
00:04:10.565 --> 00:04:15.150
"Ethan!" the junior chefs shouted happily.

62
00:04:15.151 --> 00:04:18.445
Ethan grinned at them and pointed to the table.

63
00:04:18.446 --> 00:04:21.328
"Wow, you made all this?"

64
00:04:21.329 --> 00:04:25.227
"Try a pinwheel," Nina said.

65
00:04:25.228 --> 00:04:27.823
They each took one.

66
00:04:27.824 --> 00:04:34.017
"I'll miss cooking class," Izzie said with a sigh.

67
00:04:34.018 --> 00:04:39.170
"I'm teaching another kids' class during winter break," Chef said.

68
00:04:39.171 --> 00:04:42.825
"Hooray! I'll sign up," Izzie said.

69
00:04:42.826 --> 00:04:45.950
"Can I sign up too?" Ethan asked.

70
00:04:45.951 --> 00:04:49.657
"Of course." Chef nodded.

71
00:04:49.658 --> 00:04:52.477
"I've learned something too from this class.

72
00:04:52.478 --> 00:04:58.634
Junior chefs are the best!"

